# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# GreenPoint — Terraform Configuration
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════
#
# This project has been refactored into reusable modules
# under `modules/` with environment-specific compositions
# under `envs/`.
#
# ─── For development ───────────────────────────────────
#   cd infra/terraform/envs/dev
#   cp terraform.tfvars terraform.tfvars.example   # or customize below
#   terraform init
#   terraform plan
#
# ─── For a new environment ─────────────────────────────
#   mkdir -p infra/terraform/envs/<name>
#   cp infra/terraform/envs/dev/* infra/terraform/envs/<name>/
#   ... customize main.tf and terraform.tfvars ...
#
# ─── State bootstrapping ───────────────────────────────
# Before deploying, create the S3 + DynamoDB backend:
#   cd infra/terraform/bootstrap
#   terraform apply
#
# Then uncomment the backend block in envs/<name>/versions.tf
# and run: terraform init -migrate
#
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════
